    "OA-P2-2019-MJ::1::q1-c": {
      "prompt": "(i) Harry and Byles Ltd has been in operation for the past two years. At its annual\nretreat it was agreed that fostering good relationships with colleagues would\nsignificantly contribute to the ongoing success of the business.\nIdentify THREE measures that could be taken to contribute to better working\nrelationships among colleagues.\n(3 marks)\n(ii) You are secretary to Mr Roger Byles, director of administration, and he has\ninstructed you to draft a memorandum to all clerical staff informing them of the\nupcoming automation of mailing functions scheduled to begin on 17 June 2019.\nThere will be a meeting for all clerical staff on 29 May 2019 at 2 p.m., in the main\nconference room, to introduce the use of collating, folding and sealing machines.\nAll are expected to attend.\nThe secretary is to include TWO advantages of using these different machines.\nToday’s date is to be inserted.\nWrite the memorandum using the template below.",
