    "OA-P2-2019-MJ::2::q2-c": {
      "prompt": "Melissa Jackman has been employed as a human resource clerk for the last five years\nwith Thomas and Brady Company Ltd, which is located at 200 Kings Court, Kingston,\nJamaica. She recently applied for an administrative assistant position at another company\nand was successful in securing that coveted job. Consequently, Melissa needs to write a\nletter of resignation to her current employer, giving adequate notice. Her resignation is\neffective as of 30 June 2019. Melissa should write the resignation letter to Mrs Monica\nSylverman, the human resource manager. Melissa resides at 100 Martin Place, Emerald\nCity, Spanish Town, St Catherine.\nCompose a resignation letter dated 31 May 2019 using the information above and any\nother relevant details.\n(8 marks)",
      "promptVerified": true,
      "sourcePage": 6,
