    "OA-P2-2019-MJ::3::q3-a": {
      "prompt": "Assume you have been hired as the new receptionist at Michilen Manufacturing Co. Ltd.\nState THREE ways in which you, as the new receptionist, should deal with unscheduled\nvisitors to the office.\n(3 marks)",
